    },
    {
      "text": "Flauto fatto di vetro nero. Aumenta le probabilità\ndi incontrare Pokémon forti nell’area in cui viene\nusato.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A flute made from black glass. It makes it easier to\nencounter strong Pokémon in the place you use it.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "黒いガラスで　できた　笛。\n使った　場所で　強いポケモンと\n遭遇　しやすくなる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "以黑色玻璃制成的哨子。\n在使用的地方更容易\n遇到强大的宝可梦。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una flauta de cristal negro cuyas notas atraen a\nPokémon salvajes más fuertes al lugar en el que\nse usa.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
